    <ol class="words timeline" id="run-217-words">
      <li><b>Issue created</b><small class="k">21:37 UTC</small><p>From the run analysis, with six acceptance criteria.</p></li>
      <li><b>Implementation</b><small class="k">21:38 – 22:22</small><p>claude opus, unattended; verification 1046 s; completion record: complete.</p></li>
      <li><b>Round 1 and triage</b><small class="k">22:22</small><p>M1 major, FIX_NOW.</p></li>
      <li><b>Fixes</b><small class="k">22:22 – 22:42</small><p>claude fable; verification 1049 s.</p></li>
