            <td data-col="review and fixes">{row.time}</td>
            <td data-col="active run time">{row.run}</td>
            <td data-col="tokens of review and fixes">{row.tokens}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </Table>
    <p>What the extra rounds bought: in #217, round 3 found that the fix of round 1 could still let a raised finding lose its severity, which would have weakened the very check the Issue was written to protect. Round 2, which read only the fix, found nothing; the gap showed when round 3 read the complete feature again. What they cost: the review and its two fixes took 46 of the 90 minutes, and about twelve times the tokens of the single round of #204. In #241 the one finding cost under three minutes. A round that finds nothing, as in #204, costs seconds.</p>
  </details>

