    <p><a href={issue(204)}>#204</a>: the reviewer was shown the workflow's own approval records as deleted, though the change never touched them. It ran from <code>run-feature.sh</code> to the pull request in 38 minutes: one implementation session, one verification of 909 seconds reused twice, one review that passed.</p>
