  <h3>When an agent could build before the owner decided</h3>
  <p>An agent could start building while a decision that only the owner can make was still open. The change adds the clarification step: the agent stops and asks instead. The request waited six weeks in the backlog; the run itself was short, and its single review passed. Source: <a href={issue(16)}>Issue #16</a>.</p>
